<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edges down to 1.8330 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edges down to 1.8330 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.8330 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8300 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					  March 17	   March 14</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8330	     1.8300</p>
<p> Volume traded			$9.78 million	  $6.01 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
